		{"name":"cuaddsinglekeys","args":[{"kind":"m"},{"kind":"m"}],"doc":"If the conversion is more complicated use \\cuaddsinglekeys. It adds ⟨unit-key-2⟩, etc. as values to ⟨unit-key-1⟩."},
		{"name":"cuaddtokeychain","args":[{"kind":"m"}],"doc":"\\cuaddtokeychain first parses through its unit-list and searches for a base unit key which is already in a key-chain (aka. was defined by \\cudefinekeychain). The other units, not yet part of a key-chain, are added to the same key-chain as the base unit."},
		{"name":"cuaddtokeys","args":[{"kind":"m"},{"kind":"m"},{"kind":"m"}]},
